{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:84341f988b8b3353","name":"Antiquated Weapon Template","source":{"id":"source:reference-84341f988b8b3353","title":"Antiquated Weapon Template","revision":15854,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:53:20Z","sha256":"bfa331af4cc1dd5101ec185cd571b3d3025a0a236b64844b6a52b019882c104f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=15854","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Antiquated%20Weapon%20Template&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-84341f988b8b3353","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 10% credits more than the base item. All Antiquated Weapons gain the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rare"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rare"}," availability, if they do not already have it.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Applicable To:"]}," Weapons (pre-Legacy Era; excluding ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]}," Weapons)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This Weapon Template can be applied to any weapon that doesn't appear in the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]}," and represents pre-Legacy Era technology. Most Antiquated Weapons are still fully functional but do not take advantage of the latest technological advancements.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapons:"]}," Antiquated Weapons do not use modern technology and are likely to be unfamiliar to most weaponsmiths. An Antiquated Weapon increases the base DC of any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check made to build or repair the weapon by +5. Additionally, Antiquated Energy Cells and Antiquated Power Packs for Antiquated Weapons cost 50% more than a standard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Cell"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Cell","referenceId":"reference:a3dedb9c17e4ee9d"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"},". Unless otherwise specified, an Antiquated Weapon cannot use standard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Cells"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Cells"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Packs"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Packs"},", only Antiquated Energy Cells or Antiquated Power Packs.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Refitting:"]}," An Antiquated Weapon can be ",{"tag":"a","children":["Refit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Refit"},". Apply the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Refitted Weapon Template"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Refitted_Weapon_Template","referenceId":"reference:67a1e1cbbe66b5a0"}," to the base weapon instead of the Antiquated Weapon Template.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
